id: pm-p316vn
title: "GH-953: close recovery suggested_retry is not executable and drops supplied flags"
description: Render recovery retries from the original argv and declared flag contracts so close preserves supplied named options and appends only truthful missing flags.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
