acceptance_criteria: A close recovery retry preserves all supplied named options and values; missing flags are appended as real flag tokens using declared value domains; rendered retries are shell-safe and executable after replacing placeholders; regression tests cover reason author enum boolean and quoted values; the shared SDK primitive is reusable by every CLI command
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make machine-readable recovery commands lossless and executable
value: Agents can recover in one turn without reconstructing the invocation
why_now: A current external report proves the recovery contract corrupts both supplied and missing arguments
