confidence: high
severity: high
resolution: Rebuilt recovery retries from original argv plus typed flag contracts.
expected_result: Suggested retries preserve supplied arguments and append executable missing options.
actual_result: Manual acceptance and regression tests execute the corrected strict-close retry successfully.
