close_reason: Lossless executable recovery is implemented and verified.
body: "GitHub #953 reports that the shared missing-required-option recovery path turns supplied close options into bare positional values, interpolates display labels as quoted arguments, and drops author context. Duplicate check across all 2,395 statuses found only roadmap ledgers plus pm-ulqu (enum domains), pm-6y58/pm-9qcr (boolean arity), and closed pm-5uclvd (wrong-command recovery); none owns lossless argv reconstruction."
